#. やるわね、人間！　大正解よ！
msgctxt "0001 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Correct! Well done, peasant!"
msgstr ""

#. まだ…何も言ってないのに…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...I didn't say anything yet."
msgstr ""

#. 飽きたんだよ！　もう絶望的に飽きたんだよ！
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I just got so fuckin' bored waiting, I couldn't help\n"
"it!"
msgstr ""

#. 手を変え品を変えのつもりだろうが、
#. 結局、同じ事の繰り返しじゃねーか！！
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Even if you're wrong, eventually you'll figure it out,\n"
"right? Till then, you're just goin' in circles!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、どれを選んでも正解なの！
#. 逆に斬新じゃない？
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So no matter what you pick, you get the right answer!\n"
"Pretty innovative, don't ya think?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、ビョーキですかね…？
#. 私の飽きっぽさってビョーキですよね…？
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But...do you think it might be a disease? Getting\n"
"bored so easy, I mean. Do you think I might be sick?"
msgstr ""

#. という訳で、十神クンのお家なんだけど、
#. キレイさっぱりなくなってまーす！
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Anyway, like I was saying...Byakuya's entire lineage\n"
"has been totally annihilated!"
msgstr ""

#. 何を…！　言っている…！
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What? What the hell are you talking about!?"
msgstr ""

#. 親族を含めた関係者全員の死亡を確認しました。
#. 十神家は滅亡したと断言しましょう。
msgctxt "0009 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I can confirm that his entire family has died, even\n"
"the distant relatives. The Togami name...has perished."
msgstr ""

#. ふ、ふざけた冗談は…やめろ…！
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "S-Stop with these idiotic jokes!"
msgstr ""

#. やめろ…？　命令口調だと…？
#. 人間如きが神罰の代行者である私様に…？
msgctxt "0011 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Stop? And said with such authority. A peasant would\n"
"dare challenge us, the avatar of divine punishment?"
msgstr ""

#. 身の程知らずな人間め！
#. あなたはもう“超高校級の御曹司”ですらないのよ！
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You must learn your place, peasant! You are no longer\n"
"the Ultimate Affluent Progeny!"
msgstr ""

#. ほ、滅びる訳がない…！
#. 十神家は…世界を統べる一族だ…！
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Th-They couldn't possibly be gone! The Togami family\n"
"is destined to guide the world!"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、その世界自体が終わってんだよ！
#. しかも１年も前になぁ！！
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Hell, there IS no world anymore, remember? It got\n"
"fucked a full year ago!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと待てよ…！
#. お前の言ってる事はおかしい…！
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hold on! That doesn't make any sense!"
msgstr ""

#. え？　わたしっておかしいの？
msgctxt "0016 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Huh? I don't make sense?"
msgstr ""

#. １年も前に…そんな事が起きてるはずない…！
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There's no way that happened a year ago!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、ボクらがこの学園に来たのは、
#. せいぜい数週間前の事なんだ…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I mean, we only came to this school a few weeks ago!"
msgstr ""

#. もし、１年も前に…
#. 世界が終わるような事件が起きていたなら…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If some kind of world-ending event happened a year\n"
"ago..."
msgstr ""

#. それまで、ボクらが暮らしていた世界は、
#. なんだったんだよ！？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...then how do you explain the totally normal world we\n"
"were living in up till then!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…オマエラが勘違いしてるだけじゃない？
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... Have you considered the possibility that\n"
"you're mistaken about that?"
msgstr ""

#. …勘違い？
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Mistaken...?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、さっきから聞いてれば…
msgctxt "0023 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Well, if I'm understanding you right..."
msgstr ""

#. １年前の事件が起きたのは、
#. オマエラの入学よりも前みたいな口ぶりでさ！
msgctxt "0024 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"...it sounds like you think The Tragedy happened a\n"
"year before you arrived here!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、当たり前じゃん！
#. 私達がここに来たのは、つい<CLT 3>この間<CLT>なんだよ！？
msgctxt "0025 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"W-Well, yeah! I mean, like he said, we just got here\n"
"<CLT 3>a few weeks ago<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. つい…この間…？
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "A few weeks ago...?"
msgstr ""

#. へぇ！　オマエラの中では<CLT 3>“２年前”<CLT>の事を、
#. ついこの間って言うんだね！
msgctxt "0027 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Ohh, I get it! You're saying that what happened <CLT 3>two\n"
"years ago<CLT> actually happened more recently! Right?"
msgstr ""

#. え？　２年前…？
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? Two years ago...?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、<CLT 3>２年前<CLT>じゃん。
#. オマエラが希望ヶ峰学園に入学したのって。
msgctxt "0029 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Well, I mean...you guys all started attending Hope's\n"
"Peak Academy <CLT 3>two years ago<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何が…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wait, what...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何が…２年前だって…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Two years ago? What does that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. は、はは…何を言ってんだべ、この人は…
msgctxt "0032 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hah...hahaha. What the hell is this chick trying to\n"
"say?"
msgstr ""

#. 否定したい気持ちはわかるけどさ、
#. でも、真実を否定する事は誰にも出来ないんだ…
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I understand why you'd have trouble accepting it, but\n"
"in the end, you can't deny the truth."
msgstr ""

#. 真実…原因と結果…すべては因果関係だからね。
#. それを否定するとなると、もはや神の領域だよ。
msgctxt "0034 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And the truth is, everything is cause and effect. Deny\n"
"that, and you may as well give yourself up to God."
msgstr ""

#. さて、ここまでヒントを与えれば、
#. もうおわかりになるでしょう？
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So, you must surely understand all the hints I've\n"
"given you so far, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 私が、あなた方のどんな記憶を奪ったのか…
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What are the memories I took from you?"
msgstr ""

#. さぁ、答えるがいいわ！
#. あなた達の全身全霊をもって答えるがいいわ！
msgctxt "0037 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Come now, answer us. Answer with all your heart and\n"
"soul!"
msgstr ""

#. こ、答えろったって…
msgctxt "0038 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "H-How are we supposed to answer...?"
msgstr ""

#. もう…何がなんだか…
msgctxt "0039 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I...I just don't know what's going on anymore...!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>それでも…答えるしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Still...we have to answer somehow.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このまま答えなかったら、
#. ここですべてが終わってしまうんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If we don't, everything ends right here!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 希望ヶ峰学園での学生生活
msgctxt "0043 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Our life at Hope's Peak"
msgstr ""

#. 人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件
msgctxt "0044 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The Tragedy"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件の事は、
#. 何も覚えていないわ。
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I understand what you're trying to say. I don't\n"
"remember anything about The Tragedy, either."
msgstr ""

#. でも、覚えてないのはそれだけじゃない。
#. 彼女はさっき、２年前に入学したと言ったわよね。
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But there's more to it than that. Remember, she said\n"
"something about coming here two years ago..."
msgstr ""

#. それって…つまり…
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So in other words..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>２年前に入学したのに、
#. みんなの事…何も覚えてないって事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We started attending Hope's Peak two years ago...but I\n"
"don't remember anything about anyone here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 過去の全て
msgctxt "0051 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The entire past"
msgstr ""

#. そんな訳ないよッ！！
msgctxt "0052 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Come on, man!"
msgstr ""

#. 一生懸命泳いだ事とか、優勝した時の事とか…
msgctxt "0053 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I remember swimming as hard as I could to win all\n"
"those championships..."
msgstr ""

#. おいしいドーナツの事とか、覚えてるもん！
msgctxt "0054 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "And I remember all those delicious donuts!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクだって…家族の事とかちゃんと覚えてる！
#. 入学する前日の事だって、ちゃんと覚えてる！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's right. And I remember the days before I came\n"
"here. I remember my family!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…あれ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Huh?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...Hả?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>って事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So then that means...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. そんな顔しても、もうヒントはあげないよ。
msgctxt "0059 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Make that stupid face all you want, I'm not giving you\n"
"any more hints!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0060 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは２年前に入学したはずなのに、
#. 学園生活の事を何も覚えてない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We apparently came here two years ago, but I don't\n"
"remember anything about that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ボク達が奪われた記憶…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The memories that were stolen from us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>江ノ島盾子の言う事が本当だとすると…
#. ボクらが入学したのが“２年前”だとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If what Junko says is true—if we first came here two\n"
"years ago...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは、２年前に入学したにも関わらず、
#. ここに来たのはつい最近だと思い込んでいる…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the rest of us only remember getting here within\n"
"the last few weeks or so...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると…あいつが、
#. ボク達から奪った記憶って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So the memories she took from us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お前の言葉が本当だと仮定すると、
#. ボク達は…
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If we accept that what you say is true..."
msgstr ""

#. 入学した以降の<CLT 3>２年間の記憶<CLT>を
#. すべて失ってる事になる…
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...then we've all lost our memories of <CLT 3>the last two\n"
"years<CLT>, after coming to this school."
msgstr ""

#. い、いやいや…
#. そりゃ…いくらなんでも…
msgctxt "0069 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"No. No no no no. Nope! No. I mean, no matter what\n"
"anyone says...uh-uh..."
msgstr ""

#. クッ…正解よ…！
#. やるわね、人間…！！
msgctxt "0070 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Kh—! Another correct answer...! Well done, peasant..."
msgstr ""

#. はぁぁあああッ！？　また、このパターン！？
msgctxt "0071 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Seriously!? This routine again!?"
msgstr ""

#. に、２年間の記憶を丸ごと…？
msgctxt "0072 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "We've lost two years' worth of memories...?"
msgstr ""

#. そう！　あなた達は、この希望ヶ峰学園で、
#. すでに２年間の学生生活を送っていたのよ！
msgctxt "0073 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"That's right! You've already spent two full years here\n"
"at Hope's Peak Academy!"
msgstr ""

#. そして、それを忘れたのよ！！
msgctxt "0074 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And that entire period of time...is precisely what\n"
"you've forgotten!"
msgstr ""

#. お、俺が学生生活を送ってた…？
#. そんで…それを丸っきり忘れた…？
msgctxt "0075 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I don't remember the last two years of my life...?"
msgstr ""

#. そんなん、あり得ねーって！！
msgctxt "0076 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "That...that's not possible!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あり得ない…信じられない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I want to think that, too. I don't want to believe it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、それはボクらの願望だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that's nothing but our desire.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あり得ないで欲しい…信じたくない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't want to believe... I want it to be\n"
"impossible...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、それが真実なら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But if it's the truth...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは…たどり着かなくちゃいけないんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...then we have to accept it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
